<title>USA: Czech shareholders approve name change.</title>
<headline>Czech shareholders approve name change.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech Industries Inc said stockholders overwhelming approved a name change at its annual meeting.</p>
<p>The new name, Eastbrokers International Inc, is said to better reflect the company's core business of providing financial services in central and eastern Europe.</p>
<p>The company has applied with Nasadq to change its trading symbol to  EAST.O.</p>
<p>The company anticipates a symbol change by the end of the year.</p>
</text>
